      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on this new story and i'm kind of stuck. the main character, Elias, he's just... he's reached this point where everything feels totally pointless. like, no matter what he does, the world just feels heavy and empty. i'm trying to write how he deals with that feeling of just wanting it all to stop, but i'm struggling to make it feel real. it's just a lot of darkness.",
